<title>SINGAPORE: Tri-M shares sold to Surreyville.</title>
<headline>Tri-M shares sold to Surreyville.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics firm Tri-M (S) Ltd (Tri-M) said on Monday Surreyville Pte Ltd had acquired a total of 13.98 million of its shares held by Mitsubishi Corp and Miyoshi Electronics Corp.</p>
<p>In a takeover bid for Tri-M, Surreyville had agreed to acquire 10.53 million shares from Mitsubishi and 3.45 million shares from Miyoshi on January 17. The deals were completed on January 24, a Tri-M statement said.</p>
<p>The purchase represents 46.6 percent of Tri-M's share capital.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
</text>
